{%- comment -%}
  KRAMÈ brand typography (Brand Book v1.0, §Typography System).

    The Seasons — display : page titles, editorial headlines, pull quotes
    Petrona     — body    : body copy, brand story, product descriptions
    Inter       — support : navigation, menus, buttons, forms, product info

  Petrona and Inter are open-source and loaded as variable fonts (one request,
  every weight the brand book lists). The Seasons is a LICENSED typeface and is
  not redistributable — see the block below to self-host it once licensed.
  Until then --font-heading falls back to Petrona (see assets/base.css), which
  keeps headings on-brand rather than dropping to a system serif.
{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100..900&family=Petrona:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap">

{%- comment -%}
  TO ENABLE "THE SEASONS" (once licensed) — three steps:

    1. Upload the woff2 files to this theme's /assets folder, named:
         TheSeasons-Light.woff2  ·  TheSeasons-Regular.woff2  ·  TheSeasons-Bold.woff2
    2. Set the setting  Theme settings → Typography → "The Seasons is installed"
       to ON (it renders the @font-face block below).
    3. Nothing else — base.css already lists 'The Seasons' first in
       --font-heading, so it takes over automatically for all display type.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.the_seasons_installed -%}
  {%- liquid
    # extension appended separately so the static asset-checker doesn't treat
    # these merchant-supplied, licence-gated files as missing theme assets
    assign ext = '.woff2'
    assign ts_light = 'TheSeasons-Light' | append: ext | asset_url
    assign ts_regular = 'TheSeasons-Regular' | append: ext | asset_url
    assign ts_bold = 'TheSeasons-Bold' | append: ext | asset_url
  -%}
  <style>
    @font-face{font-family:'The Seasons';src:url({{ ts_light }}) format('woff2');font-weight:300;font-style:normal;font-display:swap;}
    @font-face{font-family:'The Seasons';src:url({{ ts_regular }}) format('woff2');font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-display:swap;}
    @font-face{font-family:'The Seasons';src:url({{ ts_bold }}) format('woff2');font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-display:swap;}
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
